    39	     * Soft-deletes the entity: marks it deleted at {@code now} and merges the change.
    40	     * Idempotent for an already deleted entity.
    41	     *
    42	     * @param now deletion time supplied by the caller from the application {@code Clock}
    43	     */
    44	    void softDelete(T entity, Instant now);
